WEBVTT

00:03:28.429 --> 00:03:30.136
But to do it, you have do something

00:03:30.160 --> 00:03:32.865
that may, at first sight,
seem completely impossible.

00:03:32.889 --> 00:03:36.069
You have to survey the whole
history of the universe.

00:03:37.488 --> 00:03:38.488
So let's do it.

00:03:39.000 --> 00:03:40.909
(Laughter)

00:03:40.933 --> 00:03:44.379
Let's begin by winding the timeline back

00:03:44.403 --> 00:03:47.299
13.7 billion years,

00:03:47.323 --> 00:03:50.000
to the beginning of time.

00:03:57.321 --> 00:03:58.975
Around us, there's nothing.

00:03:59.726 --> 00:04:02.432
There's not even time or space.